atives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5563-7d1d-9022-f6f76aa586ca","description":"Odin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-79ce-b83c-b71e9283dc45","description":"Thor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-729f-a8eb-40eab09ff5da","description":"Loki","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-7117-b7da-7c17bfb74768","description":"Freya","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-763d-bdae-470653a524fc","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which parent company is known for manufacturing Post-it notes?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"3M\'s Post-it Notes grew out of Spencer Silver\'s low-tack adhesive, which Art Fry adapted to make bookmarks that stayed in place.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5563-74e5-bafa-805cf5b8d02d","description":"3M","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-70f7-93f9-33b422c675ec","description":"Sun Microsystems","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-741b-ae75-71f883c5f6e5","description":"Teflon","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-78d9-8d41-d80212f53612","description":"Del Monte","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-7776-a822-db52582b6090","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Quechua is a language spoken in which of these countries?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Quechua is an Indigenous language family of the Andes, and Bolivia recognizes Quechua among its official languages.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5563-74f8-8874-191b8ca469dc","description":"Bolivia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-7a99-b518-e01e29e0edf4","description":"Pakistan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-7a87-b7fd-e56646ccd740","description":"Morocco","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-75a5-aa29-7af94e158ae0","description":"Uganda","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5563-722d-ad4c-50e2e3861ab3","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Portuguese\' belongs to whi